WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Map each foundation gap
to the capability it blocks.

00:00:03.156 --> 00:00:07.760
Approved rules and repository
context enable reviewed drafting.

00:00:08.027 --> 00:00:12.240
Isolated runners and resettable
data enable comparable execution.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.800
Owned provider models enable
deterministic negative-path tests.

00:00:16.937 --> 00:00:21.840
Joined results and named owners
enable useful diagnosis and reuse.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.640
A missing prerequisite is
a specific engineering backlog item,

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.240
not a generic maturity score.
Foundation work starts

00:00:30.272 --> 00:00:34.000
with the pilot and determines
which capability can progress next.
